# Cross-confirm twin of freestyle_select.script: the same route with circle and cross swapped
# (0x2000 <-> 0x4000), because with EMOTIONALSENSE_CONFIRM=cross the host's cross is the
# game's confirm. Run it with --confirm cross.
# FreeStyle 4.2T: same route, but SELECT twice in the list (4T -> 3.2T ->
# 4.2T) before confirming. Enters a song the original save had locked in a
# style other than 4T. 6T is not reachable in FreeStyle: SELECT cycles
# 4T -> 3.2T -> 4.2T -> 4T.
400:4000:5
460:0008:5
@1+60:0008:5
@1+550:0020:5
@1+610:0020:5
@1+670:0020:5
@1+730:0020:5
@1+790:0020:5
@1+850:4000:5
@1+950:0020:5
@1+1010:0020:5
@1+1070:0020:5
@1+1130:0020:5
@1+1250:4000:5
